Partial fix: checks an ordering column only when it starts with `tasks:`.
The `-tasks:` and bare spellings still reach F(), and filters stay open.
The ordering test sends all three spellings.

diff --git a/label_studio/data_manager/prepare_params.py b/label_studio/data_manager/prepare_params.py
